                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9c4d69d2-4d8c-36f6-830d-d1991553d518",
                        "entry_id": "f34e8529-e6ce-3c70-b0a6-a5d25f080883",
                        "glosses": [
                            "om welke reden; om die reden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3c62664-5727-48e1-b3d3-201e300026d9",
                                "sense_id": "9c4d69d2-4d8c-36f6-830d-d1991553d518",
                                "text": "Bij de ingebruikname van de verbouwde kerk op 23 februari 1928 zei ds. Kersten dat er al veel langer plannen waren tot uitbreiding van het gebouw, maar dat de vergroting steeds niet meer dan 400 plaatsen aan het bestaande aantal zitplaatsen zou toevoegen. En dat was te weinig voor de snel uitdijende gemeente „weshalve tot deze groote verbouwing te overgegaan”, aldus het verslag van de dienst in de Nieuwe Rotterdamsche Courant van 24 februari."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0e571fd-58ab-432d-b995-09f4d8b4b3f6",
                                "sense_id": "9c4d69d2-4d8c-36f6-830d-d1991553d518",
                                "text": "Een opbeurende gedachte of vaststelling is dit uiteraard niet, weshalve wij ons zeer gelukkig mogen prijzen dat er nog schrijvers bestaan als Patrick deWitt, wiens westernkomedie The Sisters Brothers op dit moment overigens, als om het bovenstaande te staven, in filmvorm bij pers en publiek merkelijk hogere ogen lijkt te gooien dan het boek zelf ooit deed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "44a106e7-0c31-4e62-97c6-f0c1769b309a",
                        "source_entry_id": "f34e8529-e6ce-3c70-b0a6-a5d25f080883",
                        "source_sense_id": "9c4d69d2-4d8c-36f6-830d-d1991553d518",
                        "source_sense_description": "om welke reden; om die reden",
                        "target_lang_word": "wherefore",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wherefore",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76cf7e23-9a28-35ab-8bb0-7d19234ee356",
                                        "entry_id": "66fb87d3-45e1-3f8e-9ec3-311b98433212",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Why, for what reason, because of what."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "conjunctive",
                                            "interrogative",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b99a837-8001-4649-90bc-3d14e1262814",
                                                "sense_id": "76cf7e23-9a28-35ab-8bb0-7d19234ee356",
                                                "text": "Ah, Romeo, Romeo, wherefore art thou Romeo? / Denie thy Father, and refuſe thy name, / Or if thou wilt not be but ſworne my loue, / And il'e no longer be a Capulet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d764e88-734d-4932-b8ac-bda204bb33ed",
                                                "sense_id": "76cf7e23-9a28-35ab-8bb0-7d19234ee356",
                                                "text": "VVherefore weepe you?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a2d5b39-bf4e-4232-bd35-9967032dff86",
                                                "sense_id": "76cf7e23-9a28-35ab-8bb0-7d19234ee356",
                                                "text": "Wherefore doe the wicked liue, become old, yea, are mightie in power?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89c49851-7dd0-4b28-8889-e91fcc38d359",
                                                "sense_id": "76cf7e23-9a28-35ab-8bb0-7d19234ee356",
                                                "text": "And if he preached other than the right doctrine, wherefore did his superiors in the Carthusian convent permit it? If the shepherds turn a wolf in sheep's clothing into the flock, they should not blame the sheep for being worried."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efbac0e5-85e0-47f0-8d89-8a17e0dbfde1",
                                                "sense_id": "76cf7e23-9a28-35ab-8bb0-7d19234ee356",
                                                "text": "\"Good morning, Mrs. Denny,\" he said. \"Wherefore this worried look on your face? Has that reprobate James been misbehaving himself?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3f95936-623d-3f0b-b6cf-037acc87c2de",
                                        "entry_id": "66fb87d3-45e1-3f8e-9ec3-311b98433212",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Therefore; thus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "conjunctive",
                                            "formal",
                                            "indicative",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de1c648e-7736-49b9-a512-921777076b50",
                                                "sense_id": "b3f95936-623d-3f0b-b6cf-037acc87c2de",
                                                "text": "For behold, by the power of his word man came upon the face of the earth, which earth was created by the power of his word. Wherefore, if God being able to speak and the world was, and to speak and man was created, O then, why not able to command the earth, or the workmanship of his hands upon the face of it, according to his will and pleasure?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c350e9de-8c85-4a23-8136-093009279d32",
                                                "sense_id": "b3f95936-623d-3f0b-b6cf-037acc87c2de",
                                                "text": "Wherefore, Judge G. Thomas Porteous, Jr., is guilty of high crimes and misdemeanors and should be removed from office."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wherefore",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c42ad15e-3b23-340b-9561-0c9c467c7e10",
                                        "entry_id": "33a3b5c8-3f1c-345a-b46c-b183e5aab830",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Because of which."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d7a601b-1805-433d-b6dd-d0e4622eb36e",
                                                "sense_id": "c42ad15e-3b23-340b-9561-0c9c467c7e10",
                                                "text": "Wherefore, thus ſaith the holy one of Iſrael, Becauſe ye deſpise this word, and truſt in oppreſſion and peruerſeneſſe, and ſtay thereon: Therefore this iniquitie ſhalbe to you as a breach ready to fall, ſwelling out in a high wall, whoſe breaking commeth ſuddenly at an inſtant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6127a38-f843-40cc-b594-e8bfb02c53fe",
                                                "sense_id": "c42ad15e-3b23-340b-9561-0c9c467c7e10",
                                                "text": "Wherefore it was that by the time the authorities awoke to the fact that something had happened Billy Byrne was fifty miles west of Joliet, bowling along aboard a fast Santa Fe freight."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wherefore",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b7502ea-0456-399c-8996-db94f1dd7737",
                                        "entry_id": "c9588ca9-f5cb-3af5-985c-5f868eed81e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An intent or purpose; a why."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae18ee6b-b270-4f3e-95a7-149146c01cc2",
                                                "sense_id": "2b7502ea-0456-399c-8996-db94f1dd7737",
                                                "text": "Ant[ipholus of Syracuse]. Shall I tell you why? / S. Dro. [Dromio of Syracuse] I, ſir, and wherefore; for they ſay, euery why hath a wherefore."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b44971e0-161b-4745-ac20-80f590e57967",
                                                "sense_id": "2b7502ea-0456-399c-8996-db94f1dd7737",
                                                "text": "Let Us make one to seek, to seek and never to find out concerning the wherefore of the making of the gods."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "436bd965-c04a-4c48-a45e-fc1525722d02",
                                                "sense_id": "2b7502ea-0456-399c-8996-db94f1dd7737",
                                                "text": "They want their money without reference to the hows and wherefores."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
